WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:43.517 --> 00:01:46.611
It looks like it's finally about to begin.

00:01:55.695 --> 00:01:56.563
It's gone!

00:01:56.563 --> 00:01:58.865
Gone! Gone! Gone! Gone!

00:01:58.865 --> 00:02:00.400
But that's impossible!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.668
Let's see... It's not this one...

00:02:01.668 --> 00:02:04.504
Or this, or this, or this one, either!

00:02:04.504 --> 00:02:06.062
It's not here!

00:02:09.443 --> 00:02:10.510
Sasami!

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:14.742
Have you seen anything lying
around that looks something like this?

00:02:17.784 --> 00:02:23.156
No! I don't know anything
about an envelope with money in it!

00:02:23.156 --> 00:02:27.027
Oh, okay. It's nothing important...

00:02:27.027 --> 00:02:28.895
That's strange...

00:02:28.895 --> 00:02:32.032
Chocolates and candy and biscuits, and...

00:02:32.032 --> 00:02:35.202
Look, Mihoshi, we're not going there for fun.

00:02:35.202 --> 00:02:37.671
Besides, we said you can only
spend 500 yen on snacks, remember?

00:02:37.671 --> 00:02:41.174
Hey, are bananas considered snacks, too?

00:02:41.174 --> 00:02:42.709
Yes.

00:02:42.709 --> 00:02:43.810
What about apples?

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:44.811
Yes!

00:02:44.811 --> 00:02:45.779
Tangerines?

00:02:45.779 --> 00:02:46.847
Yes, they are!

00:02:46.847 --> 00:02:50.150
What about watermelons and coconuts?

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:51.785
Don't bring those along!

00:02:51.785 --> 00:02:55.755
All right, everyone...
By Father's unwitting contribution,

00:02:55.755 --> 00:02:59.426
we have managed to procure traveling money.

00:02:59.426 --> 00:03:03.063
This time... This time, we'll have
Lord Tenchi set the record straight

00:03:03.063 --> 00:03:06.800
and hear what his true feelings are!

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:09.269
This is stupid.

00:03:09.269 --> 00:03:11.605
Did you say something, Ryoko?

00:03:11.605 --> 00:03:14.841
I said, this is stupid!

00:03:14.841 --> 00:03:18.979
Tenchi went all the way
to Tokyo to train, okay?

00:03:18.979 --> 00:03:21.581
There's no way that an uptight guy

00:03:21.581 --> 00:03:25.185
like Tenchi would fall
for a girl like that Sakuya.

00:03:25.185 --> 00:03:27.954
Y-You have a point...

00:03:27.954 --> 00:03:31.424
And Tenchi does have
his own friends, you know.

00:03:31.424 --> 00:03:33.927
You just try opening your mouth around them.

00:03:33.927 --> 00:03:36.953
Even if you say it was out of love
for him, he'd still get mad at you.

00:03:37.931 --> 00:03:41.067
Well, you certainly have
it all figured out, Ryoko.

00:03:41.067 --> 00:03:46.840
Unlike a certain smug princess
I could name, I have faith in Tenchi.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.808
So do I!

00:03:48.808 --> 00:03:53.547
But even if my head understands,
my heart still needs convincing.

00:03:53.547 --> 00:03:58.952
The only way is to go see Lord
Tenchi and hear it straight from him.

00:03:58.952 --> 00:04:00.053
Suit yourself!

00:04:00.053 --> 00:04:02.222
I will!

00:04:02.222 --> 00:04:05.425
All right, let's go to Shibuya!
To Lord Tenchi's side!

00:04:05.425 --> 00:04:06.927
We're off!

00:04:06.927 --> 00:04:07.260
"Tenmangu High School
White Phoenix Festival"
We're off!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.921
"Tenmangu High School
White Phoenix Festival"

00:04:08.995 --> 00:04:11.862
Come to the concert at 2:00, okay?

00:04:17.971 --> 00:04:21.463
Step right up! Get your
delicious crêpes right here!

00:04:24.711 --> 00:04:28.081
Hey, if it isn't Masaki!

00:04:28.081 --> 00:04:32.118
I'd ask you what you're doing, but
you're probably helping Kumashiro.

00:04:32.118 --> 00:04:37.424
Yeah. Kumashiro said
that they needed some guys.

00:04:37.424 --> 00:04:41.019
Yeah, I'm helping out my girlfriend, too.

00:04:43.563 --> 00:04:48.101
To tell you the truth, I was thinking
about telling her I love her tonight.

00:04:48.101 --> 00:04:49.736
You know about it, too, right?

00:04:49.736 --> 00:04:52.205
At this school, everybody believes
that if you tell a girl you love her

00:04:52.205 --> 00:04:55.542
at the Wrap Party,
she'll fall in love with you!

00:04:55.542 --> 00:04:57.510
Yeah, I've heard about that.

00:04:57.510 --> 00:04:59.846
Tsuchida!

00:04:59.846 --> 00:05:01.982
Come on! Hurry up!

00:05:01.982 --> 00:05:03.283
I'll be right there!

00:05:03.283 --> 00:05:05.986
See you later, Masaki! Let's both go for it!

00:05:05.986 --> 00:05:08.221
Hidemi! Wait up!

00:05:08.221 --> 00:05:10.957
What kind of booth is he helping out at?

00:05:10.957 --> 00:05:15.028
Masaki, hurry! We're
about to run out of batter.

00:05:15.028 --> 00:05:16.763
Right!

00:05:16.763 --> 00:05:20.800
It's a good thing that
Masaki is helping us out.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.402
That's for sure.

00:05:22.402 --> 00:05:26.373
You're so lucky... You've got
such a nice boyfriend, Sakuya.

00:05:26.373 --> 00:05:28.975
I want a great boyfriend, too!

00:05:28.975 --> 00:05:32.045
Boyfriend? I still haven't...

00:05:32.045 --> 00:05:35.811
Oh, right. You still haven't
told him you love him, have you?

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.486
Oh, so you're gonna tell
him at the Wrap Party tonight!

00:05:39.486 --> 00:05:41.521
Huh? I'm...

00:05:41.521 --> 00:05:44.190
You're getting all
embarrassed! It's true! It's true!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.027
Come on! Move your hands, not your mouth!

00:05:47.027 --> 00:05:48.261
We're busy here!

00:05:48.261 --> 00:05:49.729
Yes, Ma'am!

00:05:49.729 --> 00:05:51.356
Geez...

00:05:52.832 --> 00:05:54.734
The crêpe burned!

00:05:54.734 --> 00:05:56.497
Hurry, put it over here!

00:05:57.971 --> 00:05:59.632
Look what you did!

00:06:02.475 --> 00:06:04.077
Lord Tenchi!

00:06:04.077 --> 00:06:05.979
Lord Tenchi?

00:06:05.979 --> 00:06:09.249
That's odd... I wonder where he went?

00:06:09.249 --> 00:06:13.620
I was certain he'd be
here all day since it's Sunday.

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:16.723
He wasn't at the Tsuchida Shrine, either...

00:06:16.723 --> 00:06:20.093
Well, it's nearly noon, so maybe
he went out to get something to eat.

00:06:20.093 --> 00:06:26.166
Sister, we really should've
talked to Tenchi before coming here...

00:06:26.166 --> 00:06:27.701
We couldn't!

00:06:27.701 --> 00:06:32.072
After all, Lord Tenchi becomes so
evasive whenever that girl comes up.

00:06:32.072 --> 00:06:38.244
The best plan is to drop in unannounced
and have him set the record straight.

00:06:38.244 --> 00:06:42.882
Well, we can't stand around
out here all day, so let's go in.

00:06:42.882 --> 00:06:45.185
Huh? But what about the lock?

00:06:45.185 --> 00:06:50.054
No problem! My Power Glove can take
care of a flimsy door like this in a jiffy!

00:06:54.194 --> 00:06:55.395
See?

00:06:55.395 --> 00:06:58.296
Go on, now! Make yourself at home!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:03.603
He isn't here, all right.

00:07:03.603 --> 00:07:07.741
Lord Tenchi isn't the sort who
would pretend not to be home...

00:07:07.741 --> 00:07:12.579
Which means that we'll have
to wait for him to come home.

00:07:12.579 --> 00:07:14.740
You're right...

00:07:16.216 --> 00:07:18.151
What is it, Ryo-Ohki?

00:07:18.151 --> 00:07:18.952
Hm? What's this?

00:07:18.952 --> 00:07:20.920
"Tenmangu High School
White Phoenix Festival"
Hm? What's this?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:21.909
"Tenmangu High School
White Phoenix Festival"

00:07:24.324 --> 00:07:26.359
Wow! This looks delicious!

00:07:26.359 --> 00:07:27.961
Go on! Eat up!

00:07:27.961 --> 00:07:30.361
Sure! Thanks!

00:07:33.032 --> 00:07:34.634
Well?

00:07:34.634 --> 00:07:37.670
It's great! It's really delicious, Kumashiro!

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:39.072
Great!

00:07:39.072 --> 00:07:42.208
To tell you the truth,
I'm taking a crash cooking class.

00:07:42.208 --> 00:07:44.199
Really?

00:07:47.213 --> 00:07:50.650
Oh, right! Want to go see the concert, Masaki?

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:51.818
Concert?

00:07:51.818 --> 00:07:54.587
See? It's starting at 2:00 in the gym.

00:07:54.587 --> 00:07:55.822
Come on, let's go!

00:07:55.822 --> 00:07:59.793
I don't mind, but is it okay
for us to leave the crêpes booth?

00:07:59.793 --> 00:08:03.997
Sure! Everybody will be at the concert,
so nobody will come to the booth.

00:08:03.997 --> 00:08:07.901
It's our School Festival, too!
We have to have fun, too! Right?

00:08:07.901 --> 00:08:11.004
I guess you're right. Why don't we
go after we get the booth cleaned up?

00:08:11.004 --> 00:08:12.631
Sure!

00:08:17.844 --> 00:08:21.681
Please, Kiyone! Buy me something! I'm hungry!

00:08:21.681 --> 00:08:26.052
<i>Okonomiyaki...</i> Or <i>yakisoba...</i> Oh!
<i>Yakitori</i> would be good, too!

00:08:26.052 --> 00:08:29.622
No. Our budget's too tight this month.

00:08:29.622 --> 00:08:33.393
I wonder where Lord Tenchi is?

00:08:33.393 --> 00:08:36.496
It won't be easy to find him in this crowd.

00:08:36.496 --> 00:08:40.466
But Lord Tenchi is here,
there's no doubt about it.

00:08:40.466 --> 00:08:44.537
At any rate, let's split up and search for him.

00:08:44.537 --> 00:08:46.402
That looks fun.

00:08:48.675 --> 00:08:49.843
Miyuki!

00:08:49.843 --> 00:08:51.435
Doctor!

00:08:52.512 --> 00:08:56.583
Miyuki finally found true love.

00:08:56.583 --> 00:09:03.289
In her heart of hearts, Miyuki wished
that this happiness would last forever.

00:09:03.289 --> 00:09:10.161
But who would suspect that moments
later a giant meteor would strike Japan?

00:09:10.897 --> 00:09:12.455
"The Giant Meteor of Love"

00:09:12.632 --> 00:09:15.658
Yeah... Right.

00:09:16.903 --> 00:09:20.773
Man, there's nothing
good to eat left in the house!

00:09:20.773 --> 00:09:27.614
Come to think about it, when
Sasami's gone, there's nobody here to cook!

00:09:27.614 --> 00:09:30.917
Maybe I should've gone with them...

00:09:30.917 --> 00:09:32.819
Ryoko!

00:09:32.819 --> 00:09:36.489
I don't know anything about an
envelope full of money that was in a book.

00:09:36.489 --> 00:09:37.724
Oh. Really?

00:09:37.724 --> 00:09:39.817
This is so strange...

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:43.827
I wonder what Tenchi's up to?

00:09:46.065 --> 00:09:48.898
Looks like I'll finish in time for the concert.

00:09:52.805 --> 00:09:55.467
Ayeka?

00:09:56.042 --> 00:09:58.111
No, it couldn't be.

00:09:58.111 --> 00:10:00.179
The Dimension Tunnel's closed.

00:10:00.179 --> 00:10:02.782
There's no way they could
come here to Tokyo so easily...

00:10:02.782 --> 00:10:05.652
Ryo-Ohki! Ryo-Ohki!

00:10:05.652 --> 00:10:08.917
Ryo-Ohki! Wait!

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:11.980
No way.

00:10:24.504 --> 00:10:28.241
What the heck is everybody doing here?!

00:10:28.241 --> 00:10:30.971
Wait, that was... Oh, no!

00:10:31.911 --> 00:10:33.613
That thing's real!

00:10:33.613 --> 00:10:39.385
That's strange... I thought I'd hit
it for sure if I used my usual gun.

00:10:39.385 --> 00:10:41.554
That's not the point!

00:10:41.554 --> 00:10:45.158
What do you think you're doing?!

00:10:45.158 --> 00:10:46.726
Tenchi!

00:10:46.726 --> 00:10:49.662
Thank goodness!
We've been looking for you!

00:10:49.662 --> 00:10:52.563
You were looking for me?
What, did something happen?

00:10:55.568 --> 00:10:56.736
The science lab!

00:10:56.736 --> 00:10:56.836
"Lab Room"
The science lab!

00:10:56.836 --> 00:10:59.439
"Lab Room"
It's a new discovery! What a big find!

00:10:59.439 --> 00:10:59.539
It's a new discovery! What a big find!

00:10:59.539 --> 00:11:04.544
To find a new species of rabbit
right in the middle of the big city!

00:11:04.544 --> 00:11:05.912
This is truly a wonder of
nature! The mystery of life!

00:11:05.912 --> 00:11:08.114
"The mystery of life"
This is truly a wonder of
nature! The mystery of life!

00:11:08.114 --> 00:11:08.381
This is truly a wonder of
nature! The mystery of life!

00:11:08.381 --> 00:11:11.250
After I entered the biology club,
they called me The Four-eyed Loser...

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:14.454
The Dissection Fanboy!
The Biology Stalker!

00:11:14.454 --> 00:11:17.857
If I don't show some results now that
I'm club president, I'll lose our budget!

00:11:17.857 --> 00:11:22.261
But if I show this new rabbit species
to the academic world, I'll be famous!

00:11:22.261 --> 00:11:25.298
Our budget will skyrocket!

00:11:25.298 --> 00:11:28.668
You're not getting away!

00:11:28.668 --> 00:11:31.504
Not to worry, little rabbit.

00:11:31.504 --> 00:11:33.840
We'll never forget your great sacrifice

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:40.541
in the service of unraveling
the great mystery of life.

00:11:48.054 --> 00:11:52.158
Come on! If we don't hurry,
the concert will start!

00:11:52.158 --> 00:11:53.292
Tenchi!

00:11:53.292 --> 00:11:55.624
Sasami! Ryo-Ohki's in trouble!

00:12:02.435 --> 00:12:05.038
Ryo-Ohki!

00:12:05.038 --> 00:12:06.973
Everything's okay now, Ryo-Ohki!

00:12:06.973 --> 00:12:08.841
Calm down, Ryo-Ohki!

00:12:08.841 --> 00:12:12.745
A-Are you okay? Hang in there!

00:12:12.745 --> 00:12:15.908
The mystery... of life...

00:12:19.519 --> 00:12:22.321
It's okay... There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:12:22.321 --> 00:12:24.881
Ryo-Ohki! Look what you did!

00:12:28.961 --> 00:12:29.162
"Festival"

00:12:29.162 --> 00:12:30.196
"Festival"
Now what?!

00:12:30.196 --> 00:12:30.396
Now what?!

00:12:30.396 --> 00:12:31.397
"Science Club New Robot Unveiling"
Now what?!

00:12:31.397 --> 00:12:32.728
"Science Club New Robot Unveiling"

00:12:32.765 --> 00:12:32.932
"Rat robot that runs through a maze"

00:12:32.932 --> 00:12:35.168
"Rat robot that runs through a maze"
Well? Think we can use it?

00:12:35.168 --> 00:12:35.201
"Rat robot that runs through a maze"
No, it's hopeless. It's totally busted.

00:12:35.201 --> 00:12:38.193
No, it's hopeless. It's totally busted.

00:12:38.671 --> 00:12:41.908
Well, would you look
at these ancient sensors...

00:12:41.908 --> 00:12:43.276
The motor's flimsy, too.

00:12:43.276 --> 00:12:47.680
On Jurai, rat robots like this
don't even show up in comic inserts!

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:49.511
So let's see what we can do with this...

00:12:51.184 --> 00:12:53.652
"Crêpes"

00:12:54.187 --> 00:12:57.122
I wonder what happened to Masaki?

00:12:57.523 --> 00:13:00.059
I don't care what happened! You overreacted!

00:13:00.059 --> 00:13:03.429
L-I'm not to blame for this!

00:13:03.429 --> 00:13:07.667
It's their fault! They lied to me,
saying you were in there, Lord Tenchi!

00:13:07.667 --> 00:13:10.403
These perverted pranks of theirs frightened me!

00:13:10.403 --> 00:13:12.138
So I just...

00:13:12.138 --> 00:13:13.973
Ayeka!

00:13:13.973 --> 00:13:18.344
Everybody worked their hardest
to get everything ready for today!

00:13:18.344 --> 00:13:20.835
And look what you did to it!

00:13:21.747 --> 00:13:24.083
I... I'm sorry.

00:13:24.083 --> 00:13:26.152
But I didn't mean them any harm!

00:13:26.152 --> 00:13:28.287
Of course you didn't!

00:13:28.287 --> 00:13:32.625
I don't know why you
came here, but I'm busy today!

00:13:32.625 --> 00:13:34.794
If you have something to say,
I'll listen to it after I go home.

00:13:34.794 --> 00:13:37.285
So until then, just go
back to my place and...

00:13:39.899 --> 00:13:42.835
Don't tell me that Washu came, too!

00:13:42.835 --> 00:13:43.736
Um... Yes.

00:13:43.736 --> 00:13:45.397
This is bad!

00:13:58.251 --> 00:14:03.712
Man, everybody's at the concert...
Nobody's coming to our booth!

00:14:05.892 --> 00:14:07.655
What's that noise?

00:14:10.029 --> 00:14:12.725
It's like it's getting closer...

00:14:19.105 --> 00:14:20.697
Wh-What the...?!

00:14:22.275 --> 00:14:24.443
I knew it... It crashes into things.

00:14:24.443 --> 00:14:27.180
Those sensors weren't in very good shape.

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:30.016
Well, that's what happens
when you build things in a hurry.

00:14:30.016 --> 00:14:31.317
Washu!

00:14:31.317 --> 00:14:32.752
Oh! Tenchi!

00:14:32.752 --> 00:14:34.453
What the heck is that?!

00:14:34.453 --> 00:14:37.089
The Washu Special Rat Robot.

00:14:37.089 --> 00:14:39.492
I took a regular rat robot and made it bigger,

00:14:39.492 --> 00:14:42.862
and then I made it run through
the halls instead of a maze.

00:14:42.862 --> 00:14:45.231
But it looks like it's not working right...

00:14:45.231 --> 00:14:47.400
So stop it! Hurry!

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.203
Well, about that...

00:14:50.203 --> 00:14:53.372
The switch was in the way, so I took it out!

00:14:53.372 --> 00:14:56.342
Lt'll keep going until its battery runs out!

00:14:56.342 --> 00:14:58.902
I had a feeling you'd say that.

00:15:03.382 --> 00:15:04.450
Oh, no!

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:07.817
I wonder what happened to Masaki?

00:15:09.388 --> 00:15:12.925
He wouldn't break our
date without saying something.

00:15:12.925 --> 00:15:15.018
So maybe something did happen to him...

00:15:18.698 --> 00:15:20.666
Kumashiro! Run!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:30.099
What was that?

00:15:37.183 --> 00:15:40.584
That was certainly a close call, Lord Tenchi.

00:15:42.755 --> 00:15:44.245
Hm?

00:15:46.492 --> 00:15:48.426
Oh, dear.

00:15:50.563 --> 00:15:51.764
Tenchi!

00:15:51.764 --> 00:15:53.599
You weren't hurt, were you?

00:15:53.599 --> 00:15:56.802
I've had enough!

00:15:56.802 --> 00:15:59.396
T-Tenchi...

00:16:04.677 --> 00:16:06.746
Go home!

00:16:06.746 --> 00:16:08.981
I'm sorry, but go home!

00:16:08.981 --> 00:16:10.983
Tenchi...

00:16:10.983 --> 00:16:13.953
You cause nothing but
trouble when you're around.

00:16:13.953 --> 00:16:15.121
B-But...

00:16:15.121 --> 00:16:17.021
Very well.

00:16:23.696 --> 00:16:26.062
Come. Let's go.

00:16:37.443 --> 00:16:39.502
Masaki...

00:16:45.151 --> 00:16:47.687
I got worried, so I came, too!

00:16:47.687 --> 00:16:50.790
I hope they aren't causing
Tenchi too much trouble.

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:54.393
Here I come!

00:16:54.393 --> 00:16:57.029
What the heck?

00:16:57.029 --> 00:16:59.896
Hey! You here, Tenchi?

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.895
Huh?

00:17:04.337 --> 00:17:07.795
The place is empty?

00:17:19.485 --> 00:17:24.090
Wow, so they came all
the way from Okayama...

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:27.827
Yeah. The School Festival was ruined.

00:17:27.827 --> 00:17:30.129
You think so? I had fun!

00:17:30.129 --> 00:17:33.766
I mean, I did get to make
crêpes with you, Masaki.

00:17:33.766 --> 00:17:35.634
Yeah, but the booths...

00:17:35.634 --> 00:17:39.038
They were gonna be broken down
once the festival ended, anyway.

00:17:39.038 --> 00:17:42.308
It just happened a bit too soon, I guess.

00:17:42.308 --> 00:17:44.076
Sorry.

00:17:44.076 --> 00:17:48.013
Why are you apologizing?
It wasn't your fault, Masaki.

00:17:48.013 --> 00:17:49.648
Oh, no!

00:17:49.648 --> 00:17:50.649
What's wrong?

00:17:50.649 --> 00:17:54.553
I forgot to thank them!
I didn't thank them for saving us!

00:17:54.553 --> 00:17:58.157
That's okay. Don't worry about it.

00:17:58.157 --> 00:18:00.059
No, that's not right.

00:18:00.059 --> 00:18:02.928
The next time we see them,
we have to remember to thank them.

00:18:02.928 --> 00:18:04.418
Right?

00:18:06.766 --> 00:18:08.200
I guess you're right.

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.690
Yeah!

00:18:17.576 --> 00:18:20.379
Kumashiro, you aren't cold, are you?

00:18:20.379 --> 00:18:21.680
No.

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:26.083
But it's kind of sad when a festival ends...

00:18:27.052 --> 00:18:29.855
Yeah...

00:18:29.855 --> 00:18:32.324
Masaki?

00:18:32.324 --> 00:18:35.027
Kumashiro?

00:18:35.027 --> 00:18:40.766
I really didn't plan to say
anything to you at the Wrap Party.

00:18:40.766 --> 00:18:44.503
I mean, I don't believe that legend...

00:18:44.503 --> 00:18:50.810
If I can just stay with
you every day, I'll be happy.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:54.280
Honest. It's the truth.

00:18:54.280 --> 00:19:00.653
But it sometimes feels like
you're really distant, Masaki...

00:19:00.653 --> 00:19:06.192
Like today. When I looked at you
as you were yelling at those people,

00:19:06.192 --> 00:19:13.566
I thought to myself, " I've never
seen Masaki look this serious before."

00:19:13.566 --> 00:19:21.140
When I did, I got so jealous of
those people and I got really sad...

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:22.641
Kumashiro...

00:19:22.641 --> 00:19:27.079
What am I saying?

00:19:27.079 --> 00:19:30.981
It's like I can't get
things straight in my head...

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:04.817
Man, everybody's flirting around here!

00:20:04.817 --> 00:20:08.254
What is it with this school?

00:20:08.254 --> 00:20:13.282
And where the heck is Tenchi?
Did he head home already?

00:20:16.061 --> 00:20:20.862
Okay, where's Tenchi... Tenchi...

00:20:45.591 --> 00:20:47.650
You stupid jerk!

00:21:00.172 --> 00:21:02.504
And so it begins.

00:21:04.009 --> 00:21:08.412
The breakup of the Masaki family...

00:21:35.941 --> 00:21:39.545
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.545 --> 00:21:43.449
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.449 --> 00:21:47.052
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.052 --> 00:21:50.990
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:54.493
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.493 --> 00:21:58.464
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.464 --> 00:22:01.800
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:05.804
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:05.804 --> 00:22:07.940
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:09.875
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:09.875 --> 00:22:11.377
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.377 --> 00:22:17.216
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.216 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:24.590
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.590 --> 00:22:28.127
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.127 --> 00:22:32.826
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:44.877 --> 00:22:46.945
Hi, Washu here!

00:22:46.945 --> 00:22:50.282
Hey, I thought it was a
little quiet here at the house...

00:22:50.282 --> 00:22:52.451
It's because Ryoko's not here, isn't it?

00:22:52.451 --> 00:22:54.920
Oh, don't worry. She's just being Ryoko.

00:22:54.920 --> 00:22:56.955
She'll come back soon enough.

00:22:56.955 --> 00:23:01.660
Anyway, there are some things
I want to look into, so I'll be in my lab.

00:23:01.660 --> 00:23:03.662
And on that note!

00:23:03.662 --> 00:23:10.465
Next time on
<i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i> "Drifting Away."
